tests
# …but the manifest must survive. `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` validates the
# lockfile against every workspace member, and `pnpm-workspace.yaml` lists
# `tests`. A missing member reads as a stale lockfile and fails the build, so the
# one file that describes it is kept while its ~1,400 test files are not.
!tests/package.json

infra/docker
